00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.780
to talk about either because
they're depressed themselves

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:18.520
or they're embarrassed that
a loved one took their life

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.870
or maybe they don't understand.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.940
