00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:32.000
I don't think necessarily.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.390
That's the whole thing,
we don't know exactly.

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.230
That's why the light needs to be shed.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:39.160
